// On C going on, takes D if L is on, else keeps Q: a D flip-flop fed by a MUX.
name Register bit
port d D in
port l L in
port c C in
port q Q out
alu U wood
chip U 0 MUX 2:1
chip U 1 D flip-flop
wire U 1:Q 0:A
wire U in:W 0:B
wire U in:N 0:S
wire U 0:Q 1:D
wire U in:S 1:C
wire U 1:Q out:E
layer
..l.
..-.
d-Uq
..-.
..c.
